Round gen_r4 complete. Summary of what shipped in `impl/gen_planner.c`:

1. **Fused register-resident CT codelets** — any node with n = r·m ≤ 25 and both stages hard leaves now runs entirely in zmm registers (19 instantiations of one always_inline body): no arena round trip, no per-leaf dispatch. This fixed the small-L overhead my r3 record flagged and reaches inner subtrees at 27/50/100 through the ordinary planner.
2. **Sub-tree diversity in enumeration** (deferred since r1) — every CT root is also emitted with the runner-up child tree; race widened to top-6.
3. **Masked 4×4 transpose edges** — scalar edge loops deleted.

